anifests, and can trigger run_exp.py on completion.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"workload\": {\n      \"run_client.sh\": {\n        \"role\": \"Simplified wrapper to run cmd/workload_client without building binaries.\",\n        \"lines\": \"workload/run_client.sh:1-62\",\n        \"notes\": [\n          \"Accepts basic knobs (-s server, -t duration, -r rate, -g GET fraction, -m scan limit, -k prefix, -N key space, -w workers, -l log file).\",\n          \"Ensures client log directory exists, runs from repo root so go modules resolve, and writes logs to logs/client.log by default.\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}
